editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/manuscript/chapter-15.md:215:*Exchange 3: he goes for the points. Right answer. She lets three go. Lag on every release, a third of a breath, every time. He tries to step through the lag and gets burned once. Learns. She lays five more on the far side while he's breaking the first lot. Nine on the floor at the end.*
