+- `COMPLETION-PLAN.md`; Lane A, Lane B, Lane 1, and Lane 2 reports
+- `EDITION_BRIEF.md` (Reader Standard and audio-first rule)
+- `OWNER-DECISIONS.md` #29 and #33
